Package: spark-dash
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Massoud Mazar <massoud@localhost>
Depends: systemd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Cluster dashboard for DGX Spark machines (spark-mini-dash)
 Polls spark-agent endpoints across a DGX Spark cluster and serves the
 1920x480 wall dashboard plus /api/state on :8080. Runs as a systemd
 service, enabled and started on install. Edit
 /etc/spark-mini-dash/config.json to list the nodes, then
 "systemctl restart spark-dash".
